(# Kristallball ? Military Asset Management) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(**Documentation report**) Tj T*
(Military Asset Management System \(vehicles, weapons, ammunition\) across multiple bases.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## 1. Purpose) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Kristallball is a web app for base-level stock. Purchases, transfers, assignments, and) Tj T*
(expenditures are the source of truth. Opening balance, net movement, available armory stock,) Tj T*
(and remaining assigned quantity are computed from those rows. They are not stored as a) Tj T*
(mutable current-balance field.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The console is a React SPA. The API is Express + Prisma on PostgreSQL. Role-based access) Tj T*
(control scopes Base Commanders and Logistics Officers to the installation on their JWT.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## 2. Architecture) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
(Browser \(React + Vite + Tailwind, port 4521\)) Tj T*
(?  /api  \(Vite proxy in development\)) Tj T*
(?) Tj T*
(Express API \(TypeScript, port 4522\)) Tj T*
(?  Helmet, CORS, JSON body parser, loggerMiddleware) Tj T*
(?  JWT authenticateToken ? authorizeRoles ? enforceBaseScope) Tj T*
(?) Tj T*
(PostgreSQL 16 \(Docker Compose, port 5432\)) Tj T*
(Prisma ORM + advisory locks for concurrent stock writes) Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Tech stack:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| Layer | Choice |) Tj T*
(| --- | --- |) Tj T*
(| Frontend | React 19, Vite 6, Tailwind CSS 4, Axios, Lucide, Recharts, Chart.js |) Tj T*
(| Backend | Node.js, Express, TypeScript, Zod |) Tj T*
(| Database | PostgreSQL via Prisma |) Tj T*
(| Auth | JWT \(`userId`, `role`, `baseId`\), bcryptjs password hashes |) Tj T*
(| API testing | Postman collection at `postman/Kristallball.postman_collection.json` |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## 3. Inventory formulas) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
(NetMovement = Purchases + TransfersIn ? TransfersOut) Tj T*
(Opening     = NetMovement_before_start ? Assigned_before ? Expended_before) Tj T*
(Closing     = Opening + NetMovement ? Assigned ? Expended) Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Only **COMPLETED** transfers are included in TransfersIn / TransfersOut.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Current holdings \(independent of the date-window cards\):) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
(Received           = Purchases + In ? Out     \(as of end date\)) Tj T*
(Available          = Received ? Assigned      \(still in the armory\)) Tj T*
(Assigned remaining = Assigned ? Expended      \(what a person still holds\)) Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Example: PFC James Okonkwo is issued 10,000 rounds and expends 5,000. Remaining on that) Tj T*
ET
endstream
