(## 4. ER schema) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
(Base 1??* User) Tj T*
(Base 1??* Personnel) Tj T*
(Base 1??* Purchase *??1 EquipmentType) Tj T*
(Base 1??* Assignment *??1 Personnel) Tj T*
(Assignment 1??* Expenditure) Tj T*
(Transfer.fromBase / Transfer.toBase ? Base) Tj T*
(User 1??* AuditLog) Tj T*
(User 1??* ApiAccessLog) Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There is no `Assets` current-qty table. Quantity is always derived. That avoids two writers) Tj T*
(disagreeing on a cached balance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(High-query indexes exist on `baseId`, `equipmentTypeId`, and `createdAt` \(and date columns) Tj T*
(used in the ledger window\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Transfer `status`: `PENDING` ? `IN_TRANSIT` ? `COMPLETED`. Stock leaves the origin only when) Tj T*
(the row becomes COMPLETED, inside a transaction that takes `pg_advisory_xact_lock\(base,) Tj T*
(equipmentType\)` and re-checks available quantity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## 5. RBAC matrix) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| Capability | ADMIN | BASE_COMMANDER | LOGISTICS_OFFICER |) Tj T*
(| --- | --- | --- | --- |) Tj T*
(| Dashboard \(opening / net / closing\) | All bases | Own base | Own base |) Tj T*
(| Holdings & personnel remaining | All | Own | Own \(read\) |) Tj T*
(| Create purchase | Yes | No | Own base |) Tj T*
(| Create / complete transfer | Any origin | No | Origin = own base |) Tj T*
(| Assign / record expenditure | Yes | Own base | No |) Tj T*
(| Audit log + HTTP access log | Yes | No | No |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(`enforceBaseScope` overwrites client `baseId` / `fromBaseId` from the JWT for non-admins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## 6. API endpoints) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Authenticated unless noted. Bearer JWT.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| Method | Path | Notes |) Tj T*
(| --- | --- | --- |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/health` | Public |) Tj T*
(| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Public; writes LOGIN audit |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Current user |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/bases` | Reference |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/equipment-types` | Reference |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/personnel` | Scoped to base for non-admin |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/dashboard/summary` | Opening / net / closing |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/dashboard/holdings` | Available + remaining |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/dashboard/personnel-holdings` | Per-person remaining |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/dashboard/net-movement` | Modal breakdown |) Tj T*
(| GET/POST | `/api/purchases` | Logistics + admin write |) Tj T*
(| GET/POST | `/api/transfers` | COMPLETED is stock-checked |) Tj T*
(| PATCH | `/api/transfers/:id/status` | Advance status |) Tj T*
(| GET/POST | `/api/assignments` | Commander + admin write |) Tj T*
ET
endstream
