(| GET/POST | `/api/assignments/expenditures` | Remaining-qty check |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/audit-logs` | Admin mutation audit |) Tj T*
(| GET | `/api/audit-logs/access` | Admin HTTP access log |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Query filters: `startDate`, `endDate`, `baseId` \(admin\), `equipmentTypeId`.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## 7. Audit model) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Two logs, on purpose:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. **AuditLog** ? written *inside* the same Prisma transaction as a purchase, transfer,) Tj T*
(assignment, expenditure, or login. If the mutation rolls back, the audit row rolls back.) Tj T*
(2. **ApiAccessLog** ? written by `loggerMiddleware` after every `/api` response except) Tj T*
(health. Stores method, path, status, duration, user. **Never stores request bodies**, so) Tj T*
(passwords cannot leak into the log.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## 8. Local setup) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requires Node 20+ and Docker Desktop \(PostgreSQL 16\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(```bash) Tj T*
(cp .env.example .env) Tj T*
(cp .env.example backend/.env) Tj T*
(cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env) Tj T*
(# set JWT_SECRET in .env and backend/.env) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(docker compose up -d) Tj T*
(npm install) Tj T*
(npm run db:setup) Tj T*
(npm run dev) Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Console: http://localhost:4521) Tj T*
(- API: http://localhost:4522/api/health) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Import `postman/Kristallball.postman_collection.json` and run **Auth ? Login as admin**.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
