(## 11. Free hosting) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Render free web services stop after ~15 minutes without HTTP traffic. Point a free monitor) Tj T*
(\(UptimeRobot or cron-job.org, 5 minute interval\) at `/api/health`. The API also pings itself) Tj T*
(in production \(`RENDER_EXTERNAL_URL` / `RAILWAY_PUBLIC_DOMAIN` / `KEEP_AWAKE_URL`\), and the) Tj T*
(browser console pings the same route while a tab is open. GitHub Actions workflow) Tj T*
(`.github/workflows/ping.yml` can curl `KEEP_AWAKE_URLS` on a 5 minute schedule.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
